roid:url" content="https://www.instagram.com/p/DSGVMK7kjM0/" /><meta property="fb:app_id" content="124024574287414" /><meta property="instapp:owner_user_id" content="37752717487" /><meta name="description" content="3,849 likes, 35 comments - throwbackculturera on December 10, 2025: &quot;NoLimit records photographed in 1998! 

No Limit Records in the 1990s was more than a label it was a full blown movement led by Master P that reshaped hip-hop from the ground up. With its unapologetic Southern sound, independent hustle, and iconic Pen &amp; Pixel album covers, No Limit flooded the streets with music and dominated the culture at a pace no one had seen before. The roster was stacked with personalities and star power, and that reach expanded even further when Snoop Dogg joined the label in the late &#x2019;90s, bringing West Coast legacy and mainstream visibility to the No Limit brand. Alongside Snoop, Mystikal became one of the label&#x2019;s most explosive stars, delivering raw energy, aggressive delivery, and chart topping records that pushed No Limit to national dominance. Together, Snoop Dogg and Mystikal showed the label&#x2019;s unique ability to blend regional sounds into one unstoppable force. No Limit wasn&#x2019;t just Southern rap it was a nationwide takeover that proved ownership, volume, and belief in your vision could change the rules of the music industry forever.&quot;. " /><meta property="og:site_name" content="Instagram" /><meta property="og:title" content="80s/90s/2000s on Instagram: &quot;NoLimit records photographed in 1998! 

No Limit Records in the 1990s was more than a label it was a full blown movement led by Master P that reshaped hip-hop from the ground up. With its unapologetic Southern sound, independent hustle, and iconic Pen &amp; Pixel album covers, No Limit flooded the streets with music and dominated the culture at a pace no one had seen before. The roster was stacked with personalities and star power, and that reach expanded even further when Snoop Dogg joined the label in the late &#x2019;90s, bringing West Coast legacy and mainstream visibility to the No Limit brand. Alongside Snoop, Mystikal became one of the label&#x2019;s most explosive stars, delivering raw energy, aggressive delivery, and chart topping records that pushed No Limit to national dominance. Together, Snoop Dogg and Mystikal showed the label&#x2019;s unique ability to blend regional sounds into one unstoppable force. No Limit wasn&#x2019;t just Southern rap it was a nationwide takeover that proved ownership, volume, and belief in your vision could change the rules of the music industry forever.&quot;" /><meta property="og:image" content="https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/588709060_18075597023261488_3822391505864432823_n.jpg?stp=c212.0.636.636a_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=101&amp;ccb=7-5&amp;_nc_sid=18de74&amp;efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&amp;_nc_ohc=Df2OrZ7RtDIQ7kNvwEMFSei&amp;_nc_oc=AdqX-Gflz2xRvlIEc1yRCaeHUhI2cZogHuWPR7zu6umCf85jrSdATCXUCDSjZXdJcR53M_e8w3oE-lUZmE-2bB5_&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com&amp;_nc_gid=oM11hXxsoHcAA10F9VSkBQ&amp;_nc_ss=7ba8c&amp;oh=00_AQPttVs5wCAG7beE22V6_gWcTG6bIBPbmxhArgyBOqE85Q&amp;oe=6ADDCCD3" /><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.instagram.com/throwbackculturera/p/DSGVMK7kjM0/" /><meta property="og:description" content="3,849 likes, 35 comments - throwbackculturera on December 10, 2025: &quot;NoLimit records photographed in 1998! 

No Limit Records in the 1990s was more than a label it was a full blown movement led by Master P that reshaped hip-hop from the ground up. With its unapologetic Southern sound, independent hustle, and iconic Pen &amp; Pixel album covers, No Limit flooded the streets with music and dominated the culture at a pace no one had seen before. The roster was stacked with personalities and star power, and that reach expanded even further when Snoop Dogg joined the label in the late &#x2019;90s, bringing West Coast legacy and mainstream visibility to the No Limit brand. Alongside Snoop, Mystikal became one of the label&#x2019;s most explosive stars, delivering raw energy, aggressive delivery, and chart topping records that pushed No Limit to national dominance. Together, Snoop Dogg and Mystikal showed the label&#x2019;s unique ability to blend regional sounds into one unstoppable force. No Limit wasn&#x2019;t just Southern rap it was a nationwide takeover that proved ownership, volume, and belief in your vision could change the rules of the music industry forever.&quot;. " /><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DSGVMK7kjM0/" /><link rel="manifest" href="/data/manifest.json" crossorigin="use-credentials" /><meta name="application-title" content="Instagram" /><meta name="color-scheme" content="light" /><style data-btmanifest="1051002150_main" nonce="8EoX0Bwb">:root, .__ig-light-mode:root, .__ig-light-mode {--fds-black:#000000;--fds-black-alpha-05:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);--fds-black-alpha-10:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);--fds-black-alpha-15:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);--fds-black-alpha-20:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);--fds-black-alpha-30:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);--fds-black-alpha-40:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);--fds-black-alpha-50:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);--fds-black-alpha-60:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);--fds-black-alpha-80:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);--fds-blue-05:#ECF3FF;--fds-blue-30:#AAC9FF;--fds-blue-40:#77A7FF;--fds-blue-60:#1877F2;--fds-blue-70:#2851A3;--fds-blue-80:#1D3C78;--fds-button-text:#444950;--fds-comment-backgroun